  "result": "{\"object\": \"list\", \"results\": [{\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"blk_0001\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"page_exam_hub\"}, \"created_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"text\": \"为什么要考\"}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"blk_0002\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"page_exam_hub\"}, \"created_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"paragraph\": {\"text\": \"在店里做了几年营业员，处方药区一直要等药师在场才能卖，很多顾客问用药问题我也只能转述说明书。想把证考下来，能自己审方，也算给这份工作一个交代。\"}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"blk_0003\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"page_exam_hub\"}, \"created_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"text\": \"目前的情况\"}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"blk_0004\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"page_exam_hub\"}, \"created_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"paragraph\": {\"text\": \"大专药学，2021 年 7 月毕业，一直在同一家店，社保没断过。工作年限这块应该是够的，但具体怎么算要看今年的通知。\"}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"blk_0005\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"page_exam_hub\"}, \"created_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2025-08-01T21:35:00+08:00\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"paragraph\": {\"text\": \"上班是排班制，早班晚班夜班都有，夜班第二天上午基本报废。家里老人晚上要人照看，晚饭后到九点这段时间腾不出来。\"}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"blk_0006