xample.test/posts/post_pharm_exam_178\", \"published_at\": \"2026-07-31T02:00:00+08:00\"}, {\"post_id\": \"post_pharm_exam_177\", \"account_id\": \"acct_pharm_exam\", \"title\": \"零售终端用药咨询能力提升培训回顾（第 10 批）\", \"summary\": \"本期培训覆盖慢病用药、儿童剂量换算与老年人多重用药，参训 550 人，考核合格率 71%。\", \"url\": \"https://notice.pharm-exam.example.test/posts/post_pharm_exam_177\", \"published_at\": \"2026-07-31T01:00:00+08:00\"}, {\"post_id\": \"post_pharm_exam_175\", \"account_id\": \"acct_pharm_exam\", \"title\": \"关于开展合理用药宣传月活动的通知（第 9 批）\", \"summary\": \"活动期间将在 289 个社区开展用药咨询义诊，欢迎执业药师报名参与志愿服务。\", \"url\": \"https://notice.pharm-exam.example.test/posts/post_pharm_exam_175\", \"published_at\": \"2026-07-31T00:00:00+08:00\"}]"
